          <ns0:quote>caribe</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>Pertaining to the sea and region of the western Atlantic bounded by South America, Central America, and the islands of the West Indies (such as Cuba and Hispaniola).</ns0:def>
