        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(historical) A medieval kingdom and former county in the Iberian Peninsula; the nucleus of modern Spain.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>A vaguely defined geographical region of central Spain generally corresponding to the regions of Old and New Castile.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
