          <ns0:quote>mar Celta</ns0:quote>
          <ns0:quote>mar Céltico</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>A sea in British Isles, Europe in the Atlantic The area of the Atlantic Ocean off the south coast of Ireland bounded by Saint George's Channel, the Bristol Channel, the English Channel, and the Bay of Biscay.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
    <ns0:entry xmlns:ns0="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
