          <ns0:quote>Zarato de Polonia</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(historical) The Kingdom of Poland created in 1815 by the Congress of Vienna as a sovereign state of the Russian part of Poland connected by personal union with the Russian Empire under the Constitution of the Kingdom of Poland until 1832.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
