          <ns0:quote>judaísmo conservador</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(Judaism) A moderate stream of Liberal Judaism centered in North America that theoretically maintains Jewish tradition and law, but provides for a more flexible interpretation of it than Orthodox Judaism, in keeping with an evolving world and society.</ns0:def>
