        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>A hard valuable metal alloy in classical antiquity, of uncertain composition, thought to have been an alloy of copper with gold and/or silver involving heat treatment and quenching, but perhaps only a very high grade of bronze.</ns0:def>
