          <ns0:quote>República Democrática de Afganistán</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(history) Former official name of Afghanistan: a landlocked country between Central Asia and South Asia; used from 1978 to 1987 when it was a one party Marxist-Leninist state; officially known as the Republic of Afghanistan from 1987 to 1992, but under the same government.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
