          <ns0:quote>Demýdivka</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>A rural settlement, the administrative centre of the settlement hromada of the same name in Dubno Raion, Rivne Oblast, Ukraine, founded in 1566.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
