          <ns0:quote>discordianismo</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>A minor new religious movement with absurdist elements, often seen as a parody, based on the worship of Eris, the Greek goddess of discord and confusion.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
