          <ns0:quote>Dorado</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(constellation) A small constellation of the southern sky, said to resemble a goldfish or swordfish. It lies between the constellations Pictor and Reticulum, and is notable for containing most of the Large Magellanic Cloud.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
