          <ns0:quote>Imperio del Japón</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(historical) Japan from the Constitution of the Empire of Japan (1890) until the enactment of the post-WWII Constitution of Japan (1947). Unofficially used for Japan from the end of the shogunate (1868) to the end of World War II (1945).</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
