          <ns0:quote>euroescéptico</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(UK form) One who is sceptical of European integration, such as the EEC, the EC, the EP, the EU, the Euro, etc.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
        <ns0:sense>
