        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>Opposition to or scepticism of increasing European integration, such as the EEC, the EC, the EP, the EU, the Euro.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>Opposition to or scepticism of the increasing powers of the European Union.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
