          <ns0:quote>Creciente Fértil</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(historical) A crescent-shaped geographic region of fertile land in the Middle East in Western Asia, stretching from present-day Iraq through eastern Turkey to Syria, Lebanon, Israel, Jordan, Palestine, Egypt and Cyprus.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
