          <ns0:def>(historical) The third month of the French Republican Calendar, from November 21, 22 or 23 to December 20, 21 or 22.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
    <ns0:entry xmlns:ns0="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
