          <ns0:quote>número de Gödel</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(logic) A number uniquely assigned to each symbol, and to each well-formed formula of some formal language.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
