          <ns0:quote>helenizar</ns0:quote>
          <ns0:quote>helenizarse</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(intransitive) To use the language and culture of the ancient Greeks, to become Hellenistic.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
