          <ns0:quote>bahía de Hudson</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>A gulf of Nunavut, Canada, a southern extension of the Arctic Ocean. A large arctic sea, surrounded on three sides, by Quebec on the east, Nunavut to the west, Manitoba to the southwest, Ontario on the south, and extending southeast becoming James Bay. To the north lies the Canadian Arctic Archipelago in the Arctic Ocean.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
