        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(historical) A former settlement in Anatolia, on the coast of the Aegean Sea; An Ancient Greek settlement on the west coast of Asia Minor inhabited by the Ionians, one of the four main Hellenic tribes.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
