        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(astronomy) A Kuiper belt object (KBO), 28978 Ixion (provisional designation 2001 KX76), once thought to be a possible dwarf planet.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
