        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>A beetle of species Popillia japonica, with iridescent copper-colored elytra and green thorax and head, an invasive pest outside of Japan.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
