      </ns0:gramGrp>
      <ns0:sense>
        <ns0:cit type="trans" xml:lang="es">
          <ns0:quote>Jesucristo</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(Christianity, Islam, Baháʼí) Jesus of Nazareth, a first-century Jewish religious preacher and craftsman (commonly understood to have been a carpenter, see TemplateParserError:LuaError) from Galilee, held to be a prophet, teacher and the Messiah, or Christ, in Christianity. Also held to be a prophet in Islam and the Baháʼí Faith.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
    <ns0:entry xmlns:ns0="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
