        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>Official name of the Netherlands: a country consisting of the Netherlands per se, in Western Europe, as well as three other small island countries in the Caribbean, namely Aruba, Curaçao and Sint Maarten.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
