        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(biochemistry, organic chemistry) A series of enzymatic reactions that occurs in all aerobic organisms, involving the oxidative metabolism of acetyl units, and serving as the main source of cellular energy.</ns0:def>
