          <ns0:quote>lego</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>Any of several small, coloured, plastic bricks, often made by the Lego Company, that can be made to join together and be taken apart, used to construct toy buildings, vehicles, etc.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
