          <ns0:quote>Caperucita Roja</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>A fairy tale about a young girl who walks through the forest to visit her grandmother and encounters the Big Bad Wolf (or another vicious wolf, or werewolf in archaic versions).</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>The girl who is the protagonist and title character in this story.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
