          <ns0:def>A metropolitan authority in Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes, France, outside of Rhône department, which includes the city of Lyon and most of its suburbs; in full, the Metropolis of Lyon.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
