          <ns0:quote>Marcos</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>Mark the Evangelist, also called John Mark, the first patriarch of Alexandria, credited with the authorship of the Gospel of Mark.</ns0:def>
