        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(star) A binary star in the constellation Cetus, Omicron (ο) Ceti. The system contains a variable red giant and a white dwarf. Its brightness varies from a magnitude 2 at its brightest to a magnitude 10 at its dimmest.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
