        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>A left tributary of Rhine, flowing through the departments of Vosges, Meurthe-et-Moselle and Moselle in northeastern France, through Luxembourg, and through the states of Rhineland-Palatinate and Saarland, Germany.</ns0:def>
