        <ns0:pron>/nɑː(r)ˈsɪsəs/</ns0:pron>
      </ns0:form>
      <ns0:gramGrp>
        <ns0:pos>pn</ns0:pos>
      </ns0:gramGrp>
      <ns0:sense>
        <ns0:cit type="trans" xml:lang="es">
          <ns0:quote>Narciso</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(Greek mythology) A youth who spurned the love of Echo and fell in love with his own reflection in a pool: in some versions of the myth, he drowned trying to reach it, while in others he sat fixated until a god took pity and transformed him into a flower.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
