        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(Greek mythology) The son of Laertes and Anticlea and father of Telemachus. A Greek leader during the Trojan War, he was responsible for the Trojan horse. He was also king of Ithaca, hero of the Iliad and protagonist of the Odyssey.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
