        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>Covering or representing all of the Americas (both North America and South America), particularly with respect to events involving representatives of most or all countries in the Americas.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
