        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(Judaism) A Jewish festival, celebrated on the 14th day of Adar, commemorating the deliverance of the Persian Jews from a complete massacre at the hand of Haman the Amalekite.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
