          <ns0:quote>rapto</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(Christianity) In some forms of fundamentalist Protestant eschatology, a prophesied sudden removal of Christian believers from the Earth before the Tribulation or simultaneous with the second coming of Jesus Christ.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
    <ns0:entry xmlns:ns0="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
      <ns0:form>
        <ns0:orth>Rapunzel</ns0:orth>
