          <ns0:quote>soneto shakespeariano</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(poetry) A sonnet comprising three quatrains and a final couplet, in iambic pentameter with the rhyme scheme of abab cdcd efef gg.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
