          <ns0:quote>relevo sueco</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>A relay race in which members of a team take turns running progressively longer parts of a course. The first member runs 100 meters, the second 200 meters, the third 300 meters, and the fourth 400 meters, equalling one kilometer in total.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
