        </ns0:sense>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(astrology) The zodiac sign for the bull, ruled by Venus and covering April 21 - May 21 (tropical astrology) or May 16 - June 15 (sidereal astrology).</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
