          <ns0:quote>mastín tibetano</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>A large dog of a breed from Central Asia, having a medium to long double coat in a wide variety of colors, sometimes with white markings around neck, chest, and legs.</ns0:def>
