      <ns0:sense>
        <ns0:cit type="trans" xml:lang="es">
          <ns0:quote>utraquismo</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(historical, Christianity) The moderate Hussite ideology that the faithful, specifically including laity, should receive Communion under both kinds (sub utraque specie), that is to say, receive both bread and wine during the Eucharist; moderate Hussitism.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
