        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(astrology) : The zodiac sign for the virgin, ruled by Mercury, that covers August 23 – September 23 (tropical astrology) or September 16 – October 15 (sidereal astrology).</ns0:def>
