          <ns0:def>(heraldry) Depicted in the same color as the field in order to imply that one can see through the element to the field; voided of the field.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
    <ns0:entry xmlns:ns0="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
