          <ns0:def>(set theory, order theory, graph theory) A subset, A, of a partially ordered set, (P, ≤), such that no two elements of A are comparable with respect to ≤.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
