        </ns0:sense>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(heraldry) A particular mark of honour, granted by the sovereign in consideration of some noble action, or by favour; and either quartered with the family arms, or on an escutcheon or canton.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
    </ns0:entry>
    <ns0:entry xmlns:ns0="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
