          <ns0:quote>cilindroeje</ns0:quote>
          <ns0:quote>neurita</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(cytology) A nerve fibre which is a long slender projection of a nerve cell, and which conducts nerve impulses away from the body of the cell to a synapse.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
