          <ns0:quote>azeótropo</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>(physics) A mixture of two or more substances whose liquid and gaseous forms have the same composition (at a certain pressure); the substances cannot be separated by normal distillation.</ns0:def>
        </ns0:sense>
      </ns0:sense>
