          <ns0:quote>guitarra baja</ns0:quote>
          <ns0:quote>bajo</ns0:quote>
        </ns0:cit>
        <ns0:sense>
          <ns0:def>A long-necked and solid-bodied stringed instrument (chordophone), tuned to produce bass or low notes, usually with a fretted fingerboard and four thick strings, and requiring the use of an amplifier.</ns0:def>
